{
  "feature": "expressions",
  "name": "Thinking deeply (natural)",
  "part": {
    "schema": "xfs/expression-part-1",
    "body": {
      "label": "Thinking",
      "controls": {
        "eye_l_blink": 0.05,
        "eye_l_brows_lateral": 0.4,
        "eye_l_brows_lower": 0.3,
        "eye_l_dir_out": 0.5,
        "eye_l_dir_up": 0.25,
        "eye_l_oculi_squint_inner": 0.3,
        "eye_r_blink": 0.05,
        "eye_r_brows_lateral": 0.4,
        "eye_r_brows_lower": 0.38,
        "eye_r_dir_in": 0.5,
        "eye_r_dir_up": 0.25,
        "eye_r_oculi_squint_inner": 0.3,
        "lips_chin_raise": 0.3,
        "lips_l_corner_wide": 0.3,
        "lips_mid_shift_l": 0.4,
        "lips_suck_dn": 0.1
      },
      "links": {
        "eye_brows_lower": false,
        "lips_corner_wide": false
      },
      "origin": {
        "kind": "rest"
      }
    }
  },
  "facs": {
    "closestVanilla": "facial_bored",
    "actionUnits": [
      {
        "au": "AU4",
        "name": "Brow lowerer",
        "intensity": "B",
        "note": "The concentration furrow.",
        "controls": [
          "eye_l_brows_lower",
          "eye_r_brows_lower",
          "eye_l_brows_lateral",
          "eye_r_brows_lateral"
        ]
      },
      {
        "au": "AU7",
        "name": "Lid tightener",
        "intensity": "B",
        "controls": [
          "eye_l_oculi_squint_inner",
          "eye_r_oculi_squint_inner"
        ]
      },
      {
        "au": "AU61+63",
        "name": "Eyes turn left and up",
        "intensity": "C",
        "note": "A glance away from the listener while thinking; both eyes turn toward V's left.",
        "controls": [
          "eye_l_dir_out",
          "eye_r_dir_in",
          "eye_l_dir_up",
          "eye_r_dir_up"
        ]
      },
      {
        "au": "AU43",
        "name": "Eyes lowered (slight)",
        "intensity": "A",
        "controls": [
          "eye_l_blink",
          "eye_r_blink"
        ]
      },
      {
        "au": "AU14",
        "name": "Dimpler (unilateral), mouth to one side",
        "intensity": "B",
        "controls": [
          "lips_mid_shift_l",
          "lips_l_corner_wide"
        ]
      },
      {
        "au": "AU17+28",
        "name": "Chin raiser, lower lip in",
        "intensity": "B / A",
        "controls": [
          "lips_chin_raise",
          "lips_suck_dn"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "why": [
      "A small furrow (AU4 with AU7) and a glance up and to the side are the recognisable signs of someone thinking. The gaze does most of the work.",
      "The mouth is pushed sideways (a one-sided AU14 with a mouth shift) and pressed by a chin raise: a private, unposed face.",
      "Everything stays under about half strength. In photo mode, turn the camera look-at off or the eyes will follow the camera."
    ],
    "source": "XF Studio experiment 026 (research/animation/natural-expressions.md): authored values, tuned in the live preview."
  }
